cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Proxecto Karaoke en Galego in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Proxecto Karaoke en Galego"
abstract: >-
  Proxecto Karaoke en Galego turns any song into a karaoke whose lyrics light up exactly as they
  are sung. It is built for Galician first and works with songs in any language: it separates the
  vocals, transcribes the lyrics or aligns the ones given with a model for each language, and
  plays the result on phones, laptops and TVs from a home server, or exports it as video. Every
  model was chosen with a benchmark of freely licensed songs.
